  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『SKG』腰部按摩仪 G5</strong></span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">SKG腰部按摩仪G5，通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”。用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，可以获取腰部按摩仪的按摩状态、电池电量显示等信息，以及控制按摩仪的按摩手法、按摩模式、热敷模式等，如下视频 1-1。</span></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/d8bbb8d77b8a47599e440b1b655d0176.png?auth_key=1795677429-e8506e973b33475d87531050c259fa46-0-9544c53d3cb46ee898ffc67fb8750f8cd1bab50286815760a326f28b2c18c7cf\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/dcd3d7559fd744999dcd2364b0f2493c.mp4?auth_key=1795677429-89ac3ed075704267aee1f6711d0d1339-0-6240f99b5e8a8c0f9edf7e27d4c050efd24b5bed554c1417709a42b2e22361cc\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">视频 1-1 腰部按摩仪</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机大屏显示和控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏控制腰部按摩仪的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">按摩时长调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">按摩手法切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">脉冲按摩/振动按摩/热敷模式强度调节；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/4b22fb587f544ffab9da76bf23939d8e.png?auth_key=1795677429-a4ec1491398d4ca38ffcc22414c20750-0-c811fb0df8fcb731b6cfd6e07136223d32d9332541fda2da32d9290e8169a1f6\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 521.00px;height: 828.77px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 车机大屏操控</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/de8c098312aa42929cfebeabf5b808e5.png?auth_key=1795677429-e1870ed717c54384b9763a844d9a961d-0-7dfd0317579fac7ba26c3869825165e0fd0a7e53c31f45f2773e5c8ea4e43b50\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 788.00px;height: 443.23px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-2 智慧物联App设备详情界面</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 车机语音控制</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音提示和控制腰部按摩仪的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">电池电量播报；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">按摩时长设置；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">当前按摩手法播报和设置；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">脉冲按摩/振动按摩/热敷模式播报和调节；</span></li></ul><p><br></p>"
}
